  "prefLabel": "Env-A 3203.35 “NOx allowance tracking system” (NATS) means the computerized system operated and maintained by the department for purposes of tracking allowance use for the Ac",
  "recordType": "rule-section",
  "ruleText": "Env-A 3203.35 “NOx allowance tracking system” (NATS) means the computerized system operated and maintained by the department for purposes of tracking allowance use for the Acid Rain Program, and for purposes of this chapter, used to track the number of allowances held and used by any person.\n\nSource. #11001, eff 1-1-16; ss by #14632, eff 6-25-26, EXPIRES: 6-25-36 (formerly Env-A 3203.39)",
